### Algorithm 10: System Calibration and Deployment Certificate

```
ALGORITHM 10: DCO_Calibrate(ensemble, task_corpus, ε, δ, T_kelvin)

INPUT:  Model ensemble, calibration corpus, PAC params ε, δ, temperature
OUTPUT: Fully calibrated system state S_certified, deployment certificate

